usting the authenticity  and the currents of the message that we  have and the kind of evidence we had  with overwhelming evidence of areas  where certain figures were inflated in  favor of mr. managua areas where they  deflated figures that were are coming  the embassy alliance side so do you have  evidence hard core evidence in fact  paper evidence we live in forms which  our polling station best forms those who  are going to use at appropriate levels  in engaging Zach but also in  articulating our message to the  international world but more importantly  we want to appreciate the support we've  had from the international community for  genuine free and fair elections and also  for making sure that there's  accountability which has been lacking in  this election do you really think you  can overturn the presidential result in  the courts we weren't going to overturn  anything if anything what we are going  to over ten is the declaration by Zach  the result is in our favor such as if  we've been defeated with more votes than  mr. minagawa in the popular vote I won  the presidency mr. mellenburg was then  declared president so there's an anomaly  we need to undo the damage done by Zach  because of their lack of integrity their  lack of consistent and of course there  are partisanship their bias is  unbelievable it even stinks in high  heaven do you want people to come out  onto the streets are you calling for  demonstrations I've seen what's happened  earlier this week I've said that because  of homelessness joblessness and  hopelessness in the country people are  already in the streets so I can't call  them to come where they are already they  are resident in the streets  automatically they are there because of  poverty in on disenfranchisement and of  course the disappointment that they had  a raw deal of missed opportunities and  neglected advantages on account of what  is happening in this country so what I  simply have to do is to activate those  people in show